39	            tekuConfig
40	                .powchain()
41	                .getDepositTreeSnapshotConfiguration()
42	                .isBundledDepositSnapshotEnabled(),
43	            tekuConfig.metricsConfig().isBlobSidecarsStorageCountersEnabled()));
44	    Optional<ExecutionWeb3jClientProvider> maybeExecutionWeb3jClientProvider = Optional.empty();
45	    if (tekuConfig.executionLayer().isEnabled()) {
46	      // Need to make sure the execution engine is listening before starting the beacon chain
47	      ExecutionLayerService executionLayerService =
48	          ExecutionLayerService.create(serviceConfig, tekuConfig.executionLayer());
49	      services.add(executionLayerService);
50	      maybeExecutionWeb3jClientProvider = executionLayerService.getEngineWeb3jClientProvider();
51	    }
52	    services.add(new BeaconChainService(serviceConfig, tekuConfig.beaconChain()));
53	    services.add(
54	        new NatService(
55	            tekuConfig.natConfiguration(),
56	            tekuConfig.network().getListenPort(),
57	            tekuConfig.discovery().isDiscoveryEnabled()));
58	    powchainService(tekuConfig, serviceConfig, maybeExecutionWeb3jClientProvider)
59	        .ifPresent(services::add);
60	
61	    final Optional<SlashingRiskAction> maybeValidatorSlashedAction =
62	        tekuConfig.validatorClient().getValidatorConfig().isShutdownWhenValidatorSlashedEnabled()
63	            ? Optional.of(new SlashedValidatorShutDown())
64	            : Optional.empty();
65	
66	    services.add(
67	        ValidatorClientService.create(
68	            serviceConfig,
69	            tekuConfig.validatorClient(),
70	            new DoppelgangerDetectionShutDown(),
71	            maybeValidatorSlashedAction));
72	  }
73	
74	  private Optional<PowchainService> powchainService(
75	      final TekuConfiguration tekuConfig,
76	      final ServiceConfig serviceConfig,
77	      final Optional<ExecutionWeb3jClientProvider> maybeExecutionWeb3jClientProvider) {
78	    if (tekuConfig.beaconChain().interopConfig().isInteropEnabled()
79	        || (!tekuConfig.powchain().isEnabled() && maybeExecutionWeb3jClientProvider.isEmpty())) {
80	      return Optional.empty();
81	    }
82	
83	    return Optional.of(
84	        new PowchainService(
85	            serviceConfig, tekuConfig.powchain(), maybeExecutionWeb3jClientProvider));
86	  }
